  nonce: eb26  # eb26
  message: "PREMISE CHECK 2026-09-30 (dev 134a06d505): CURRENT-WITH-UPDATES. The mechanism holds; the title's number and \"largest bucket\" claim no longer do.\nCODE: _type_of (swift.py ~1656) still consults _scoped_types over function ancestors, then var_types, then _inherited_field_type, as described. Binding sources (~1666-1720): property_declaration (declared type, else _swift_call_result_type via the return-type registry -- WI-higob ccaefb05fa, 09-04, i.e. BEFORE this item was filed), if/guard let (729e41e71e, 09-04), parameter. No closure-parameter, tuple-destructuring or if-case binding arm exists.\nRE-MEASURED with the item's own instrument (dodop_swift_09102026/untyped.py, unchanged, run in-process on ~/whole_bunch_of_repos/vapor @ ff88583; output in ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/dryrun_09302026/C/swift_untyped.out):\n  method edges 5,243 (was 4,944); typed 1,885 = 36.0% (was 2,112 = 42.7%); untyped 3,358.\n  2,295 classified, 559 multi-call lines dropped (19.6%, under the 25% cap).\n     923  A: chain off simple_identifier   (NEW label; 0 before)\n     622  B: lowercase hint -- _type_of returned None   (was 938 = 49.0%; now 27.1%)\n     435  A: self.<method>()   (WI-sizas)\n     166  A: chain off navigation_expression (was 112)\n      56  A: self.<property>.<method>()  (was 393 -- PR #877 held)\nWHY IT MOVED: b4fc27e0c7 (WI-sulas, 09-26) \"a value chain v.p.m() is not typed by its head v\" -- a 2+-hop chain on a lowercase head now carries no hint, so sites that used to count here as hint=head/_type_of=None now land in \"chain off simple_identifier\". The same commit explains the fall in typed share (wrong head typing removed). The item's population is therefore split: 622 single-hop sites + an unknown part of the 923 chain sites whose head is itself untyped.\nExample in the 622 bucket: AsyncWebSocketTests.swift:146 ws.onText { ws, string in -- ws there is a closure parameter. The per-cause breakdown the item asks for was NOT done.\nNOT checked: io-boundaries / module-slot (L4) effect; this instrument counts receiver_type_hint only.\nPROPOSAL: retitle to the 622 figure (and drop \"the largest bucket\"), note the WI-sulas re-bucketing, and cross-link WI-sizas (self.<method>), WI-janad (any P), INV-bisok (Alamofire Session)."  # eb26
